00:27:31.690 --> 00:27:33.770
You know, sometimes when I watch TV...

00:27:34.890 --> 00:27:35.910
I get a little scared.

00:27:36.520 --> 00:27:36.740
Oh!

00:27:37.540 --> 00:27:37.860
What?

00:27:40.580 --> 00:27:40.820
Oh, my gosh.

00:27:41.060 --> 00:27:44.660
shows and videos us little kids should watch with our families.

00:27:45.510 --> 00:27:46.950
Like mom or dad.

00:27:47.430 --> 00:27:48.030
Wait, wait, wait, wait.

00:27:48.170 --> 00:27:49.030
father or sister.

00:27:49.480 --> 00:27:50.000
Well,

00:27:50.470 --> 00:27:51.830
Maybe not all of them at once.

00:27:52.900 --> 00:27:54.700
Our responsibility is moms and dads.

00:27:54.980 --> 00:27:56.160
to know what our kids are watching.

00:27:56.740 --> 00:27:58.380
So let's take the time to watch with them.

00:28:00.350 --> 00:28:03.430
Tomorrow on Batman, when unusual robberies plague Gotham.

00:28:03.490 --> 00:28:04.130
We got company!

00:28:04.290 --> 00:28:06.170
The Dark Knight tracks a chilling foe.

00:28:06.190 --> 00:28:07.910
Mr. Freeze to you.

00:28:08.030 --> 00:28:09.510
And makes a shocking discovery.

00:28:09.690 --> 00:28:12.450
The stolen objects combine into a massive weapon.

00:28:12.610 --> 00:28:13.590
Very good.

00:28:14.040 --> 00:28:15.840
A detective to the last.

00:28:15.960 --> 00:28:18.920
Watch Batman the Animated Series tomorrow afternoon on Fox.
